Here is the commit message:
ACCUMULO-3859 Ensure multiple TableConfiguration instances
 are not created.

If an instance of a TableConfiguration is cached which isn't the same
instance held by a Tablet, this will result in the Tablet never
receiving updates for constraints and more.

Here is the root cause:
The root cause of the bug is the potential creation of multiple instances of `TableConfiguration` for the same table. If a `Tablet` holds a different instance than the one cached, it will not receive updates for constraints and other configurations, leading to inconsistencies and outdated information being used by the `Tablet`.

